> No Problem,
> Just send us the list of workstations and a statement of purpose/description
> of what you need that many IPs for.  The internic won't directly give you 15
> class Cs as they are experiencing a shortage of them, in turn this affects  
> the number of class Cs that are distributed to IDT.  Documentation is now   
> required to obtain a class C license.  You may want to include the number of
> workstations that each company will be using (plus the network default 
> and  router IP).  As soon as we recieve this information, we will do our 
> best to obtain 15 class C licenses for you.

