Marco,

Thank your for willing to help us test the Net2Phone product.
To get a copy, use netscape to go to URL ftp://haven.ios.com/pub/users/netftp/
and download idtn2p.exe
Then execute that program in a separate directory where it will self-expand.
Finally, execute the setup.exe program in that directory.

Of course this should be done on a PC (486/33 min, higher preferred) that
has a mic,speakers, and an internet connection of at least 28.8.

Run the program and you should be able to register to place calls.

Send me some email as to when you want to run the test so we will have the 
server running. Then call me using the local number "3630213,24" . DO NOT
ADD AREA CODES OR INTERNATIONAL ACCESS CODES, since this number is dialed
from Lakewood NJ.

Please call between 10 AM and 6 PM US Eastern Standard Time.

Also, please do not place calls at other times since we are busy making some
other changes to the server software.

Thanks Again,

Jeff

Jeff Goldberg, IDT Labs (908) 363-0213 x24  jeffg@haven.ios.com

