Dear Sir,
I see that in the last period is very difficult to have answers from IDT.

We asked you (in the last month):

1 - 15 new Class C addresses (and we sent you all the info you asked)
2 - if we can mirror our site on your machines and how much is the cost
3 - if is possible to delegate the reverse addressing of the Class C
address 206.20.231. to the following DNS 206.20.231.241.

I'm sure that you are very busy, but we need at least an answer from your
Company, as we have to give answers to our customers.

Waiting for your kind reply, I send you my best regards

------------------------------------------------------------------------
Maurizio Gerosa - Technical Director - Internet Force srl - Milan - Italy
